# XSH sigdelset()
# Copyright (c) 2026 Nicholas Martin. All rights reserved.

assertion  XSH.sigdelset.001
anchor     functions/sigdelset.html#DESCRIPTION
class      required
since      1988
says       On a full set, sigdelset() of SIGUSR1, then of SIGRTMIN, returns 0
           each time; afterwards those two are not members and every other
           table signal still is.
uses       XSH.sigismember.001
test       t/001-deletes-one.c
